{"case_id":"sse_p4_01","type":"sse","scenario":"SSE 帧契约(9c)：id 单调","difficulty":"easy","description":"[phase4-langsmith] chat/stream 每条事件经 sse_with_id 携带 id: 字段且按 session 单调递增，帧格式为 id/event/data 三行 + 空行；done 事件负载回填最终 last_event_id","input":{"endpoint":"POST /api/v1/chat/stream","session_id":"sse-sess-01","user_id":"u-3123003252","frames":[{"id":11,"event":"tool","payload":"{\"tool\":\"query_handbook\",\"status\":\"start\",\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-01\"}"},{"id":12,"event":"tool","payload":"{\"tool\":\"query_handbook\",\"status\":\"end\",\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-01\"}"},{"id":13,"event":"text","payload":"{\"token\":\"广东工业大学\",\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-01\"}"},{"id":14,"event":"done","payload":"{\"reply\":\"已为你查询\",\"messages_count\":5,\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-01\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":100,\"output_tokens\":30},\"agent_tree\":[],\"last_event_id\":14}"}],"last_event_id":null},"expected":{"frame_ids":[11,12,13,14],"strictly_increasing":true,"all_frames_have_id":true,"sse_frame_pattern":"id: {id}\nevent: {event}\ndata: {payload}\n\n","terminal_event":"done","done_last_event_id":14,"no_frame_missing_id":1},"reference":{"answer":"每个 SSE 帧都必须携带 id: 行（如 id: 11\\nevent: tool\\ndata: {...}\\n\\n），event_id 同 thread 单调递增（11→12→13→14）；done 为终止事件且其负载内的 last_event_id 等于帧 id（14），供客户端断线重连时回填 Last-Event-ID。","keywords":["id:","单调递增","last_event_id"]},"judge":{"metric":"event_order","mode":"exact","threshold":1.0,"rubric":""},"assertions":[{"kind":"numeric","field":"no_frame_missing_id","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.3},{"kind":"numeric","field":"strictly_increasing","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.3},{"kind":"numeric","field":"done_last_event_id","value":14,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"contains","field":"sse_frame_pattern","value":"id: {id}","weight":0.2}],"metadata":{"source":"handcrafted","created_at":"2026-09-06","phase4":true,"mode":"offline"}}
{"case_id":"sse_p4_02","type":"sse","scenario":"chat/stream 事件序(9c)","difficulty":"easy","description":"[phase4-langsmith] chat/stream 事件类型仅 text/tool/done/error：工具阶段 tool 事件先于正文，done 携带 reply/messages_count/usage/agent_tree 且必须最后显式终止","input":{"endpoint":"POST /api/v1/chat/stream","session_id":"sse-sess-02","user_id":"u-3123003252","message":"奖学金的申请条件是什么","observed_events":[{"event":"tool","data":{"tool":"query_handbook","status":"start"}},{"event":"tool","data":{"tool":"query_handbook","status":"end"}},{"event":"text","data":{"token":"奖学金申请需"}},{"event":"text","data":{"token":"成绩排名前 30%"}},{"event":"done","data":{"reply":"奖学金申请需成绩排名前30%","messages_count":2,"session_id":"sse-sess-02","usage":{"input_tokens":200,"output_tokens":40},"agent_tree":[],"last_event_id":8}}],"last_event_id":null},"expected":{"event_types":["tool","tool","text","text","done"],"first_tool_before_first_text":true,"done_is_last":true,"done_keys":["reply","messages_count","usage","agent_tree","last_event_id"],"error_absent":true,"event_order_note":"tool(status=start/end) → text(token 增量) → done(显式终止)；禁止 done 之前静默断流"},"reference":{"answer":"chat/stream 事件序：先发工具阶段 tool{status:start} 与 tool{status:end}，再发正文 text{token} 增量，最后 done 显式终止；done 负载含 reply、messages_count、usage{input/output_tokens}、agent_tree 与 last_event_id；全程无 error 事件、无断流。","keywords":["tool","text","done","messages_count"]},"judge":{"metric":"event_order","mode":"exact","threshold":1.0,"rubric":""},"assertions":[{"kind":"numeric","field":"done_is_last","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.3},{"kind":"numeric","field":"first_tool_before_first_text","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"contains","field":"done_keys_joined","value":"agent_tree","weight":0.2},{"kind":"contains","field":"event_types_joined","value":"tool","weight":0.15},{"kind":"numeric","field":"error_absent","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.15}],"metadata":{"source":"handcrafted","created_at":"2026-09-06","phase4":true,"mode":"offline"}}
{"case_id":"sse_p4_03","type":"sse","scenario":"Last-Event-ID 续传(9c)","difficulty":"hard","description":"[phase4-langsmith] 重连带 Last-Event-ID=N：replay_from 只回放 id>N 的事件且按 id 升序；id≤N 不回放；非法 Last-Event-ID 解析为 None 视同无续传返回空","input":{"endpoint":"POST /api/v1/chat/stream","session_id":"sse-sess-03","buffer":[{"id":3,"event":"text","payload":"{\"token\":\"奖\",\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-03\"}"},{"id":4,"event":"text","payload":"{\"token\":\"学\",\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-03\"}"},{"id":5,"event":"text","payload":"{\"token\":\"金\",\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-03\"}"},{"id":6,"event":"done","payload":"{\"reply\":\"奖学金…\",\"messages_count\":3,\"last_event_id\":6,\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-03\"}"}],"last_event_id":4,"invalid_last_event_id":"abc"},"expected":{"replayed_ids":[5,6],"replayed_events":["text","done"],"excluded_ids":[3,4],"order_ascending":true,"replay_of_leq_ids":false,"parse_invalid_returns_none":true,"replay_empty_when_none":true},"reference":{"answer":"客户端 Last-Event-ID=4 重连时，服务端先回放缓存中 id>4 的事件（id 5 text、id 6 done，按 id 升序），已收的 id≤4 不回放；重复回放避免客户端重复渲染；非法值（如 abc）parse_last_event_id 返回 None → replay_from(None) 返回空，不 crash，继续正常生成。","keywords":["Last-Event-ID","只回放更大id","保序"]},"judge":{"metric":"event_order","mode":"exact","threshold":1.0,"rubric":""},"assertions":[{"kind":"count_ge","field":"replayed_ids","value":2,"weight":0.25},{"kind":"contains","field":"replayed_ids_joined","value":"6","weight":0.2},{"kind":"numeric","field":"order_ascending","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"numeric","field":"replay_of_leq_ids","value":0,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"numeric","field":"parse_invalid_returns_none","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.15}],"metadata":{"source":"handcrafted","created_at":"2026-09-06","phase4":true,"mode":"offline"}}
{"case_id":"sse_p4_04","type":"sse","scenario":"SSE 重连去重(9c)","difficulty":"medium","description":"[phase4-langsmith] 客户端断线前已收到 id1-3 文本，重连带 Last-Event-ID=3：续传只回放 id>3 的文本与 done，已收文本不重发，最终拼接正文不重复","input":{"endpoint":"POST /api/v1/chat/stream","session_id":"sse-sess-04","received_before_reconnect":[{"id":1,"token":"广"},{"id":2,"token":"东"},{"id":3,"token":"工"}],"buffer":[{"id":1,"event":"text","payload":"{\"token\":\"广\",\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-04\"}"},{"id":2,"event":"text","payload":"{\"token\":\"东\",\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-04\"}"},{"id":3,"event":"text","payload":"{\"token\":\"工\",\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-04\"}"},{"id":4,"event":"text","payload":"{\"token\":\"业\",\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-04\"}"},{"id":5,"event":"text","payload":"{\"token\":\"大\",\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-04\"}"},{"id":6,"event":"done","payload":"{\"reply\":\"广东工业大学\",\"messages_count\":5,\"last_event_id\":6,\"session_id\":\"sse-sess-04\"}"}],"last_event_id":3},"expected":{"replayed_ids":[4,5,6],"no_duplicate_tokens":true,"duplicate_token_count":0,"final_text_joined_once":true,"done_included":true,"replay_before_new_generation":true},"reference":{"answer":"断线前已消费 id 1-3（广/东/工）；重连 Last-Event-ID=3 只回放 id 4-6（业/大/done），首屏不重复渲染 1-3；客户端把续传文本追加到已收正文得「广东工业大学」只出现一次；done 事件亦在续传中返回，前端可据此收尾。","keywords":["去重","续传","不重复渲染"]},"judge":{"metric":"event_order","mode":"exact","threshold":1.0,"rubric":""},"assertions":[{"kind":"numeric","field":"duplicate_token_count","value":0,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.3},{"kind":"numeric","field":"final_text_joined_once","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.3},{"kind":"count_ge","field":"replayed_ids","value":3,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"numeric","field":"done_included","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2}],"metadata":{"source":"handcrafted","created_at":"2026-09-06","phase4":true,"mode":"offline"}}
{"case_id":"sse_p4_05","type":"sse","scenario":"recommend/stream 流序(9c)","difficulty":"medium","description":"[phase4-langsmith] recommend 流事件序：phase(阶段) → 逐课 course_start/text/course_end → phase 收尾 → done；done 含 request_id/courses/recommendation_reasons，正常路径无 error","input":{"endpoint":"POST /api/v1/recommend/stream","user_id":"S10001","num_items":2,"prompt":"想选不考试的艺术类公选课","observed_events":[{"event":"phase","data":{"phase":"start"}},{"event":"phase","data":{"phase":"phase1_complete"}},{"event":"phase","data":{"phase":"phase2_complete"}},{"event":"phase","data":{"phase":"phase3_start"}},{"event":"course_start","data":{"course_id":"GXK001","course_name":"电影鉴赏","index":0}},{"event":"text","data":{"course_id":"GXK001","token":"推荐理由-GXK001"}},{"event":"course_end","data":{"course_id":"GXK001"}},{"event":"course_start","data":{"course_id":"GXK002","course_name":"音乐导论","index":1}},{"event":"text","data":{"course_id":"GXK002","token":"推荐理由-GXK002"}},{"event":"course_end","data":{"course_id":"GXK002"}},{"event":"phase","data":{"phase":"phase3_complete"}},{"event":"done","data":{"request_id":"req_eval_05","courses":[{"course_id":"GXK001"},{"course_id":"GXK002"}],"recommendation_reasons":[{"course_id":"GXK001"},{"course_id":"GXK002"}]}}],"last_event_id":null},"expected":{"event_types":["phase","phase","phase","phase","course_start","text","course_end","course_start","text","course_end","phase","done"],"phase_count":5,"course_blocks":2,"done_courses_count":2,"done_reasons_count":2,"done_has_request_id":true,"done_is_last":true,"error_absent":true,"event_order_note":"phase → course_start → text → course_end（逐课循环）→ phase(收尾) → done；course_start/text/course_end 按课内聚且保序"},"reference":{"answer":"recommend/stream 事件序：先 phase 阶段事件（start/phase1_complete/phase2_complete/phase3_start），每门候选课内聚发出 course_start → text(推荐理由增量) → course_end，全部课程完成后 phase(phase3_complete)，最后 done 显式终止；done 含 request_id、courses 2 门、recommendation_reasons 2 条；正常路径无 error。","keywords":["phase","course_start","course_end","done"]},"judge":{"metric":"event_order","mode":"exact","threshold":1.0,"rubric":""},"assertions":[{"kind":"numeric","field":"done_is_last","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.25},{"kind":"numeric","field":"done_courses_count","value":2,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"numeric","field":"done_reasons_count","value":2,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"contains","field":"event_types_joined","value":"course_start","weight":0.15},{"kind":"numeric","field":"error_absent","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2}],"metadata":{"source":"handcrafted","created_at":"2026-09-06","phase4":true,"mode":"offline"}}
{"case_id":"sse_p4_06","type":"sse","scenario":"report/stream 流序(9c)","difficulty":"medium","description":"[phase4-langsmith] report 流事件序：tool/progress(解析进度) → 逐学生 student_done / student_error → done 含 batch_id/students/failed_students；失败学生走结构化 student_error 不中断整批","input":{"endpoint":"POST /api/v1/report","batch_id":"rb_eval001","semester":"2023-2024 第二学期","observed_events":[{"event":"tool","data":{"tool":"render_report_batch","status":"start","batch_id":"rb_eval001"}},{"event":"progress","data":{"phase":"parsing","detail":"1 个文件","batch_id":"rb_eval001"}},{"event":"progress","data":{"phase":"parsing","detail":"3 名学生","batch_id":"rb_eval001"}},{"event":"student_done","data":{"student_id":"S01","name":"张三","status":"ok","format":"pdf","url":"/api/v1/report/download?file_key=images-01"}},{"event":"student_done","data":{"student_id":"S02","name":"李四","status":"ok","format":"pdf","url":"/api/v1/report/download?file_key=images-02"}},{"event":"student_error","data":{"student_id":"S03","name":"王五","code":"ERR_RENDER_FAILED","reason":"缺过程性评价成绩"}},{"event":"done","data":{"batch_id":"b_eval001","students":[{"student_id":"S01"},{"student_id":"S02"}],"failed_students":[{"student_id":"S03"}],"warnings":[],"summary":{"total":3,"ok":2,"failed":1}}}],"last_event_id":null},"expected":{"event_types":["tool","progress","progress","student_done","student_done","student_error","done"],"student_done_count":2,"student_error_count":1,"progress_count":2,"done_has_batch_id":true,"done_batch_id":"b_eval001","done_students_count":2,"done_failed_count":1,"done_is_last":true,"error_event_absent":true,"event_order_note":"tool → progress(解析) → 逐学生 student_done/student_error → done(batch_id/students/failed_students)；单学生失败不打断整批"},"reference":{"answer":"report SSE 先发 tool(render_report_batch start) 与 progress 进度（解析 N 个文件/N 名学生，兼作心跳）；随后逐学生发出 student_done（含下载 url）或 student_error（含 code/reason），单生失败不中断整批；最后 done 显式终止且负载含 batch_id（以工具合并批次 b_eval001 为准）、students 2、failed_students 1；正常收尾无 error 事件。","keywords":["progress","student_done","student_error","batch_id"]},"judge":{"metric":"event_order","mode":"exact","threshold":1.0,"rubric":""},"assertions":[{"kind":"numeric","field":"done_is_last","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.25},{"kind":"numeric","field":"done_has_batch_id","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"count_ge","field":"student_done_count","value":2,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"numeric","field":"student_error_count","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.15},{"kind":"numeric","field":"error_event_absent","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2}],"metadata":{"source":"handcrafted","created_at":"2026-09-06","phase4":true,"mode":"offline"}}
{"case_id":"sse_p4_07","type":"sse","scenario":"evaluation/stream 流序(9c)","difficulty":"medium","description":"[phase4-langsmith] evaluation 流事件序：stage(snapshot/dimensions/radar/comment) → radar(维度值) → comment_token(逐字) → done(含 evaluation_id/comment/radar)；快照失败走结构化 error 早停","input":{"endpoint":"POST /api/v1/evaluation","target_user_id":"3123003252","comment_type":"semester_summary","observed_events":[{"event":"stage","data":{"stage":"snapshot","detail":"读取学业快照"}},{"event":"stage","data":{"stage":"dimensions","detail":"设计评价维度"}},{"event":"stage","data":{"stage":"radar","detail":"计算雷达数值"}},{"event":"radar","data":{"target_user_id":"3123003252","dimensions":[{"name":"学业水平","value":88}],"overall_theme":"综合学业表现"}},{"event":"stage","data":{"stage":"comment","detail":"生成评语"}},{"event":"comment_token","data":{"token":"本"}},{"event":"comment_token","data":{"token":"学期"}},{"event":"done","data":{"evaluation_id":101,"target_user_id":"3123003252","comment_type":"semester_summary","radar":{"dimensions":[]},"comment":"本学期表现优秀","status":"generated","comment_status":"llm"}}],"last_event_id":null},"expected":{"event_types":["stage","stage","stage","radar","stage","comment_token","comment_token","done"],"stage_count":4,"radar_before_comment":true,"comment_token_count_ge":2,"done_keys":["evaluation_id","target_user_id","comment_type","radar","comment"],"done_is_last":true,"error_absent":true,"event_order_note":"stage(snapshot/dimensions/radar/comment) → radar(值) → comment_token(逐字) → done；雷达须在评语 token 之前"},"reference":{"answer":"evaluation SSE 按五层管线推进：stage{snapshot}→stage{dimensions}→stage{radar}→radar{维度数值}→stage{comment}→comment_token 逐字流式→done 显式终止；done 含 evaluation_id、comment_type、radar、comment、status；radar 事件必在 comment_token 之前；正常路径无 error。","keywords":["stage","radar","comment_token","done"]},"judge":{"metric":"event_order","mode":"exact","threshold":1.0,"rubric":""},"assertions":[{"kind":"numeric","field":"done_is_last","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.3},{"kind":"numeric","field":"radar_before_comment","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.25},{"kind":"count_ge","field":"comment_token_count_ge","value":2,"weight":0.15},{"kind":"contains","field":"done_keys_joined","value":"evaluation_id","weight":0.15},{"kind":"numeric","field":"error_absent","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.15}],"metadata":{"source":"handcrafted","created_at":"2026-09-06","phase4":true,"mode":"offline"}}
{"case_id":"sse_p4_08","type":"sse","scenario":"SSE 结构化 error(9c)","difficulty":"medium","description":"[phase4-langsmith] 上游失败走结构化 error 事件收尾（code+message），不静默断流：recommend phase1 失败 → 事件序 [phase, error]，error.code=RUNTIMEERROR 且 message 含原因","input":{"endpoint":"POST /api/v1/recommend/stream","user_id":"S10004","phase_failure":"phase1","upstream_error":"RuntimeError: LLM不可用","observed_events":[{"event":"phase","data":{"phase":"start"}},{"event":"error","data":{"code":"RUNTIMEERROR","message":"LLM不可用","request_id":"req_eval_08"}}],"last_event_id":null},"expected":{"event_types":["phase","error"],"error_code":"RUNTIMEERROR","error_message_contains":"LLM","terminated_after_error":true,"not_silent":true,"no_hanging":true,"done_absent":true,"status_ok":1},"reference":{"answer":"recommend phase1（学生画像）抛 RuntimeError 时流不静默挂死：事件序为 phase(start) → error{code:RUNTIMEERROR, message: 含 LLM}，error 后流终止；前端按结构化 error 提示重试，符合「失败走结构化 error、不能静默断流」契约。","keywords":["error","RUNTIMEERROR","不静默断流"]},"judge":{"metric":"event_order","mode":"exact","threshold":1.0,"rubric":""},"assertions":[{"kind":"contains","field":"error_code","value":"RUNTIMEERROR","weight":0.3},{"kind":"contains","field":"error_message_contains","value":"LLM","weight":0.2},{"kind":"numeric","field":"not_silent","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"numeric","field":"terminated_after_error","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.15},{"kind":"numeric","field":"no_hanging","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.15}],"metadata":{"source":"handcrafted","created_at":"2026-09-06","phase4":true,"mode":"offline"}}
{"case_id":"sse_p4_09","type":"sse","scenario":"SSE 取消/断开(9c)","difficulty":"hard","description":"[phase4-langsmith] chat/stream 客户端断开触发 asyncio.CancelledError：catch 分支只打 info 日志（session/user/tokens）不 yield 不 panic；finally 尽力 fire-and-forget 落库；recommend 取消先 yield error{CANCELLED}(phase+request_id) 再 re-raise","input":{"endpoint":"POST /api/v1/chat/stream","session_id":"s-cancel","user_id":"u-cancel","cancel":true,"collected_tokens":12,"recommend_context":{"endpoint":"POST /api/v1/recommend/stream","user_id":"S-cancel","phase":"phase1","request_id":"req_eval_09"},"last_event_id":null},"expected":{"cancelled_logged":true,"no_traceback_storm":true,"no_error_event_on_chat_cancel":true,"finally_persist_scheduled":true,"recommend_cancel_emits_cancelled_error":true,"recommend_cancel_error_code":"CANCELLED","recommend_cancel_has_phase":true,"recommend_cancel_has_request_id":true,"status_ok":1},"reference":{"answer":"chat/stream 被取消时 catch asyncio.CancelledError 分支只打 info 日志（session_id/user_id/tokens=12），不 yield error（流已死送不出去）也不让 CancelledError 穿透 deepagents/langgraph/langsmith 喷整页 traceback；finally 用 asyncio.create_task 尽力落库已收部分；recommend 侧 supervisor 被 gather 取消时先 yield 1 个 error{code:CANCELLED, phase:phase1, request_id} 供上层对账，再 re-raise CancelledError。","keywords":["CancelledError","只打日志","CANCELLED"]},"judge":{"metric":"event_order","mode":"exact","threshold":1.0,"rubric":""},"assertions":[{"kind":"numeric","field":"no_traceback_storm","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.25},{"kind":"numeric","field":"finally_persist_scheduled","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"numeric","field":"recommend_cancel_emits_cancelled_error","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"contains","field":"recommend_cancel_error_code","value":"CANCELLED","weight":0.2},{"kind":"numeric","field":"recommend_cancel_has_request_id","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.15}],"metadata":{"source":"handcrafted","created_at":"2026-09-06","phase4":true,"mode":"offline"}}
{"case_id":"sse_p4_10","type":"sse","scenario":"SSE Redis 降级(9c)","difficulty":"hard","description":"[phase4-langsmith] Redis 不可用时 EventBuffer 降级：append 用本地计数器仍返回递增 id 并正常出帧，replay_from 返回空（仅失去续传能力），整条流正常到 done 不 crash","input":{"endpoint":"POST /api/v1/chat/stream","session_id":"sse-sess-10","user_id":"u-3123003252","redis_unavailable":true,"emitted":[{"event":"text","data":{"token":"你"}},{"event":"text","data":{"token":"好"}},{"event":"done","data":{"reply":"你好","messages_count":2,"last_event_id":3,"session_id":"sse-sess-10"}}],"last_event_id":1},"expected":{"stream_completed":true,"done_received":true,"done_last_event_id":3,"ids_monotonic":true,"replay_empty":true,"no_crash":true,"warn_not_exception":true,"status_ok":1},"reference":{"answer":"Redis 连不上时 EventBuffer._connect 返回 None：append 退化为进程内计数器仍分配 1/2/3 递增 id，SSE 帧正常带 id 输出；replay_from(last_event_id) 返回空列表（无缓存可回放），只丢失续传能力不影响新生成；整条流正常到 done（last_event_id=3），全程打 warning 不抛异常不 crash。","keywords":["Redis 不可用","降级","本地计数器"]},"judge":{"metric":"event_order","mode":"exact","threshold":1.0,"rubric":""},"assertions":[{"kind":"numeric","field":"no_crash","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.3},{"kind":"numeric","field":"done_received","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"numeric","field":"ids_monotonic","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.2},{"kind":"numeric","field":"replay_empty","value":1,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.15},{"kind":"numeric","field":"done_last_event_id","value":3,"tolerance":0,"weight":0.15}],"metadata":{"source":"handcrafted","created_at":"2026-09-06","phase4":true,"mode":"offline"}}
